{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q001", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 1, "question_type": "choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["间断点", "极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q001.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "函数在 $x=0,\\pm1$ 处都有可能出现间断。化简\n$$\nf(x)=\\frac{x}{x+1}\\sqrt{1+\\frac1{x^2}}\\quad(x\\ne1).\n$$\n当 $x\\to0$ 时，左右极限分别为 $1$ 与 $-1$，故 $x=0$ 是跳跃间断点；当 $x\\to1$ 时极限存在且有限，故 $x=1$ 是可去间断点；当 $x\\to-1$ 时分母趋于 $0$ 而分子不为 $0$，故 $x=-1$ 是无穷间断点。因此无穷间断点只有 $1$ 个。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q002", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 2, "question_type": "choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["一阶线性微分方程", "非齐次方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q002.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "A", "explanation": "由 $y_1,y_2$ 都满足非齐次方程可知\n$$\n(\\lambda y_1-\\mu y_2)'+p(x)(\\lambda y_1-\\mu y_2)=(\\lambda-\\mu)q(x).\n$$\n它是齐次方程的解，因此 $(\\lambda-\\mu)q(x)=0$，而非齐次方程中 $q(x)\\not\\equiv0$，故 $\\lambda=\\mu$。又\n$$\n(\\lambda y_1+\\mu y_2)'+p(x)(\\lambda y_1+\\mu y_2)=(\\lambda+\\mu)q(x),\n$$\n要仍为原方程的解，就需 $\\lambda+\\mu=1$。联立得\n$$\n\\lambda=\\mu=\\frac12.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q003", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 3, "question_type": "choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["曲线相切", "导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q003.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "C", "explanation": "设切点为 $(x_0,x_0^2)$，则两曲线在该点既有相同函数值，又有相同导数：\n$$\nx_0^2=a\\ln x_0,\\qquad 2x_0=\\frac{a}{x_0}.\n$$\n由第二式得 $a=2x_0^2$。代回第一式：\n$$\nx_0^2=2x_0^2\\ln x_0\\Rightarrow \\ln x_0=\\frac12,\n$$\n故 $x_0=\\sqrt e$，从而\n$$\na=2x_0^2=2e.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q004", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 4, "question_type": "choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["反常积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q004.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "在 $x\\to0^+$ 时，$\\ln(1-x)\\sim -x$，故被积函数与 $x^{\\frac1m-\\frac1n}$ 同阶。这里 $m,n$ 为正整数，所以指数始终大于 $-1$，在 $0$ 附近总可积。  \n在 $x\\to1^-$ 时，令 $t=1-x$，则被积函数与 $|\\ln t|^{2/m}$ 同阶，而\n$$\n\\int_0^\\delta |\\ln t|^{2/m}\\,dt\n$$\n总收敛。因此该积分对任意正整数 $m,n$ 都收敛。", "methods": ["比较判别法"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q005", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 5, "question_type": "choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["隐函数", "齐次函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q005.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "B", "explanation": "由\n$$\nF\\!\\left(\\frac{y}{x},\\frac{z}{x}\\right)=0\n$$\n可知 $\\dfrac{z}{x}$ 仅依赖于 $\\dfrac{y}{x}$，即存在函数 $\\varphi$ 使\n$$\nz=x\\,\\varphi\\!\\left(\\frac{y}{x}\\right).\n$$\n因此 $z$ 是关于 $(x,y)$ 的一次齐次函数。由 Euler 齐次函数定理，\n$$\nxz_x+yz_y=z.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q006", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 6, "question_type": "choice", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二重积分", "Riemann 和"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q006.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "A", "explanation": "将和式改写为\n$$\n\\sum_{i=1}^n\\sum_{j=1}^i \\frac{1}{n^2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\left(1+\\frac{i}{n}\\right)\\left(1+\\left(\\frac{j}{n}\\right)^2\\right)}.\n$$\n令 $x=\\dfrac{i}{n},\\ y=\\dfrac{j}{n}$，则取样区域满足\n$$\n0\\le y\\le x\\le1.\n$$\n故该极限对应的二重积分为\n$$\n\\int_0^1 dx\\int_0^x \\frac{1}{(1+x)(1+y^2)}\\,dy.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q007", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 7, "question_type": "choice", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["向量组", "秩"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q007.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "A", "explanation": "向量组 I 可由向量组 II 线性表示，所以\n$$\nr(\\text{I})\\le r(\\text{II})\\le s.\n$$\n若向量组 I 线性无关，则其秩等于向量个数，即 $r(\\text{I})=r$，于是\n$$\nr\\le s.\n$$\n其余选项都不能由题设必然推出。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q008", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 8, "question_type": "choice", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["特征值", "实对称矩阵"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q008.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-1.png"], "answer": "D", "explanation": "由 $A^2+A=O$ 得\n$$\nA(A+E)=O,\n$$\n所以任一特征值 $\\lambda$ 满足\n$$\n\\lambda^2+\\lambda=0\\Rightarrow \\lambda=0\\text{ 或 }-1.\n$$\n又因 $A$ 为实对称矩阵，必可正交相似对角化。秩为 $3$ 表明恰有三个非零特征值，因此这三个特征值都只能是 $-1$，另一个特征值是 $0$。故\n$$\nA\\sim \\operatorname{diag}(-1,-1,-1,0).\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q009", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 9, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["常系数线性微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q009.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$C_1e^{2x}+e^x\\bigl(C_2\\cos x+C_3\\sin x\\bigr)$", "explanation": "特征方程为\n$$\nr^3-2r^2+r-2=0=(r-2)(r^2+1).\n$$\n故特征根为 $r=2,\\ \\pm i$。因此通解为\n$$\ny=C_1e^{2x}+e^x\\bigl(C_2\\cos x+C_3\\sin x\\bigr).\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q010", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 10, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["渐近线"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q010.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$y=2x$", "explanation": "作多项式除法：\n$$\n\\frac{2x^3}{x^2+1}=2x-\\frac{2x}{x^2+1}.\n$$\n当 $x\\to\\pm\\infty$ 时，余项趋于 $0$，故斜渐近线为\n$$\ny=2x.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q011", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 11, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["高阶导数", "幂级数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q011.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$-2^n(n-1)!$", "explanation": "由\n$$\n\\ln(1-2x)=-\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}\\frac{(2x)^k}{k}\\qquad(|x|<\\tfrac12),\n$$\n可得 $x^n$ 的系数为 $-\\dfrac{2^n}{n}$。因此\n$$\ny^{(n)}(0)=n!\\left(-\\frac{2^n}{n}\\right)=-2^n(n-1)!.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q012", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 12, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["极坐标曲线", "弧长"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q012.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$\\sqrt2\\,(e^{\\pi}-1)$", "explanation": "极坐标弧长公式为\n$$\ns=\\int_0^{\\pi}\\sqrt{r^2+\\left(\\frac{dr}{d\\theta}\\right)^2}\\,d\\theta.\n$$\n这里 $r=e^{\\theta}$ 且 $r'=e^{\\theta}$，所以\n$$\ns=\\int_0^{\\pi}\\sqrt{2e^{2\\theta}}\\,d\\theta\n=\\sqrt2\\int_0^{\\pi}e^{\\theta}\\,d\\theta\n=\\sqrt2\\,(e^{\\pi}-1).\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q013", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 13, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["相关变化率"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q013.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$3\\text{ cm/s}$", "explanation": "设对角线长为 $s$，则\n$$\ns^2=l^2+w^2.\n$$\n两边对时间求导：\n$$\n2s\\frac{ds}{dt}=2l\\frac{dl}{dt}+2w\\frac{dw}{dt}.\n$$\n当 $l=12,w=5$ 时，$s=13$，故\n$$\n\\frac{ds}{dt}=\\frac{12\\cdot2+5\\cdot3}{13}=3\\text{ cm/s}.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q014", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 14, "question_type": "fill_blank", "score": 4, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["行列式", "矩阵运算"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q014.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "$3$", "explanation": "由\n$$\nA^{-1}+B=A^{-1}(E+AB)\n$$\n得\n$$\n|A^{-1}+B|=|A|^{-1}|E+AB|=2.\n$$\n代入 $|A|=3$，可得\n$$\n|E+AB|=6.\n$$\n又\n$$\nA+B^{-1}=B^{-1}(AB+E),\n$$\n故\n$$\n|A+B^{-1}|=|B|^{-1}|AB+E|=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot6=3.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q015", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 15, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分函数", "单调性", "极值"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q015.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "单调递减区间为 $(-\\infty,-1)\\cup(0,1)$，单调递增区间为 $(-1,0)\\cup(1,+\\infty)$；极大值为 $f(0)=\\dfrac{e^{-1}-1}{2}$，极小值为 $f(\\pm1)=0$。", "explanation": "将积分拆开：\n$$\nf(x)=x^2\\int_1^{x^2}e^{-t^2}\\,dt-\\int_1^{x^2}te^{-t^2}\\,dt.\n$$\n求导得\n$$\nf'(x)=2x\\int_1^{x^2}e^{-t^2}\\,dt.\n$$\n令 $f'(x)=0$，得驻点 $x=0,\\pm1$。再求二阶导数\n$$\nf''(x)=2\\int_1^{x^2}e^{-t^2}\\,dt+4x^2e^{-x^4}.\n$$\n由 $f''(0)=2\\int_1^0e^{-t^2}dt<0$，知 $x=0$ 为极大值点；而 $f''(\\pm1)=4e^{-1}>0$，知 $x=\\pm1$ 为极小值点。结合\n$$\n\\int_1^{x^2}e^{-t^2}\\,dt\n$$\n在 $x^2<1$ 时为负、在 $x^2>1$ 时为正，可得单调性结论。又\n$$\nf(0)=\\int_1^0(-t)e^{-t^2}\\,dt=\\frac{e^{-1}-1}{2},\\qquad f(\\pm1)=0.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q016", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 16, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分估计", "极限"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q016.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-2.png"], "answer": "(I) 前者小于后者；(II) $\\displaystyle \\lim_{n\\to\\infty}nu_n=0$。", "explanation": "对 $0<t<1$，有\n$$\n0<\\ln(1+t)<t.\n$$\n因此\n$$\n0<|\\ln t|\\,[\\ln(1+t)]^n<t^n|\\ln t|,\n$$\n从而\n$$\n\\int_0^1 |\\ln t|\\,[\\ln(1+t)]^n\\,dt<\\int_0^1 t^n|\\ln t|\\,dt.\n$$\n又\n$$\n\\int_0^1 t^n|\\ln t|\\,dt=\\frac{1}{(n+1)^2},\n$$\n故\n$$\n0<nu_n<\\frac{n}{(n+1)^2}\\to0.\n$$\n由夹逼定理，\n$$\n\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}nu_n=0.\n$$", "methods": ["夹逼定理"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q017", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 17, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["参数方程", "二阶导数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q017.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$\\psi(t)=t^3+\\dfrac32t^2$", "explanation": "先求\n$$\n\\frac{dx}{dt}=2+2t=2(1+t),\\qquad \\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{\\psi'(t)}{2(1+t)}.\n$$\n于是\n$$\n\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}\n=\\frac{\\dfrac{d}{dt}\\left(\\dfrac{\\psi'(t)}{2(1+t)}\\right)}{2(1+t)}\n=\\frac{(1+t)\\psi''(t)-\\psi'(t)}{4(1+t)^3}.\n$$\n与题设比较得\n$$\n(1+t)\\psi''(t)-\\psi'(t)=3(1+t)^2.\n$$\n令 $v=\\psi'(t)$，则\n$$\n(1+t)v'-v=3(1+t)^2.\n$$\n解得\n$$\nv=3(1+t)^2+C(1+t).\n$$\n由 $\\psi'(1)=6$ 得 $12+2C=6$，故 $C=-3$，于是\n$$\n\\psi'(t)=3t(t+1).\n$$\n积分得\n$$\n\\psi(t)=t^3+\\frac32t^2+C_1.\n$$\n再由 $\\psi(1)=\\dfrac52$，得 $C_1=0$。", "methods": ["隐函数求导", "参数方程求导"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q018", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 18, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["定积分应用", "平面图形面积"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q018.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png", "images/q018_diagram.png"], "answer": "$M=\\rho abl\\left(\\dfrac{2\\pi}{3}+\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{4}\\right)$", "explanation": "椭圆截面方程可写为\n$$\n\\frac{x^2}{a^2}+\\frac{y^2}{b^2}=1.\n$$\n油面高度为 $\\dfrac{3b}{2}$，说明顶部尚有一段高度为 $\\dfrac{b}{2}$ 的空缺弓形。  \n整个椭圆面积为 $\\pi ab$。顶部弓形面积为\n$$\nS_0=2\\int_{b/2}^{b} a\\sqrt{1-\\frac{y^2}{b^2}}\\,dy\n=2ab\\int_{1/2}^{1}\\sqrt{1-u^2}\\,du\n=ab\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}-\\frac{\\sqrt3}{4}\\right).\n$$\n因此油的截面积\n$$\nS=\\pi ab-S_0\n=ab\\left(\\frac{2\\pi}{3}+\\frac{\\sqrt3}{4}\\right).\n$$\n体积 $V=Sl$，故油的质量为\n$$\nM=\\rho V=\\rho abl\\left(\\frac{2\\pi}{3}+\\frac{\\sqrt3}{4}\\right).\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q019", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 19, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["偏微分方程"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q019.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$a,b$ 为方程 $5r^2+12r+4=0$ 的两个根，即 $a=-2,\\ b=-\\dfrac25$（或交换次序）。", "explanation": "由链式法则，\n$$\nu_x=u_\\xi+u_\\eta,\\qquad u_y=au_\\xi+bu_\\eta.\n$$\n进一步可得\n$$\nu_{xx}=u_{\\xi\\xi}+2u_{\\xi\\eta}+u_{\\eta\\eta},\n$$\n$$\nu_{xy}=a u_{\\xi\\xi}+(a+b)u_{\\xi\\eta}+b u_{\\eta\\eta},\n$$\n$$\nu_{yy}=a^2u_{\\xi\\xi}+2abu_{\\xi\\eta}+b^2u_{\\eta\\eta}.\n$$\n代入原式后，若要化为 $u_{\\xi\\eta}=0$，就必须令 $u_{\\xi\\xi}$ 与 $u_{\\eta\\eta}$ 的系数同时为零，即\n$$\n4+12a+5a^2=0,\\qquad 4+12b+5b^2=0.\n$$\n解得\n$$\n5r^2+12r+4=0\\Rightarrow r=-2,\\ -\\frac25.\n$$\n故可取\n$$\n(a,b)=\\left(-2,-\\frac25\\right)\n$$\n或交换次序。", "methods": ["换元积分", "链式法则"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q020", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 20, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["二重积分"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q020.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-3.png"], "answer": "$\\displaystyle I=\\frac13-\\frac{\\pi}{16}$", "explanation": "改用直角坐标。由\n$$\nx=r\\cos\\theta,\\qquad y=r\\sin\\theta\n$$\n知区域 $D$ 对应为\n$$\n0\\le y\\le x\\le1.\n$$\n又\n$$\nr^2\\cos2\\theta=x^2-y^2,\\qquad r^2\\sin\\theta\\,drd\\theta = y\\,dxdy.\n$$\n因此\n$$\nI=\\int_0^1dx\\int_0^x y\\sqrt{1-x^2+y^2}\\,dy.\n$$\n对内层积分令 $u=1-x^2+y^2$，得\n$$\n\\int_0^x y\\sqrt{1-x^2+y^2}\\,dy\n=\\frac13\\left[1-(1-x^2)^{3/2}\\right].\n$$\n于是\n$$\nI=\\frac13\\int_0^1\\left[1-(1-x^2)^{3/2}\\right]dx\n=\\frac13-\\frac13\\int_0^1(1-x^2)^{3/2}dx.\n$$\n令 $x=\\sin t$，则\n$$\n\\int_0^1(1-x^2)^{3/2}dx=\\int_0^{\\pi/2}\\cos^4 t\\,dt=\\frac{3\\pi}{16}.\n$$\n故\n$$\nI=\\frac13-\\frac{\\pi}{16}.\n$$", "methods": ["极坐标变换"]}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q021", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 21, "question_type": "solution", "score": 10, "module": "高等数学", "topics": ["微分中值定理", "构造函数"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q021.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "结论成立。", "explanation": "构造函数\n$$\nH(x)=f(x)-\\frac{x^3}{3}.\n$$\n则\n$$\nH(0)=f(0)=0,\\qquad H(1)=f(1)-\\frac13=0.\n$$\n分两种情形。  \n若 $H\\!\\left(\\dfrac12\\right)=0$，则由 Rolle 定理分别在区间 $\\left[0,\\dfrac12\\right]$ 和 $\\left[\\dfrac12,1\\right]$ 上可得存在\n$$\n\\xi\\in\\left(0,\\frac12\\right),\\quad \\eta\\in\\left(\\frac12,1\\right)\n$$\n使\n$$\nH'(\\xi)=0,\\qquad H'(\\eta)=0.\n$$\n即\n$$\nf'(\\xi)=\\xi^2,\\qquad f'(\\eta)=\\eta^2.\n$$\n于是结论成立。  \n若 $H\\!\\left(\\dfrac12\\right)\\ne0$，则由拉格朗日中值定理，在 $\\left[0,\\dfrac12\\right]$ 上存在 $\\xi\\in\\left(0,\\dfrac12\\right)$ 使\n$$\nH'(\\xi)=\\frac{H(1/2)-H(0)}{1/2}=2H\\!\\left(\\frac12\\right),\n$$\n在 $\\left[\\dfrac12,1\\right]$ 上存在 $\\eta\\in\\left(\\dfrac12,1\\right)$ 使\n$$\nH'(\\eta)=\\frac{H(1)-H(1/2)}{1/2}=-2H\\!\\left(\\frac12\\right).\n$$\n故\n$$\nH'(\\xi)+H'(\\eta)=0.\n$$\n又 $H'(x)=f'(x)-x^2$，所以\n$$\nf'(\\xi)+f'(\\eta)=\\xi^2+\\eta^2.\n$$\n结论得证。", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q022", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 22, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["线性方程组", "秩"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q022.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "$\\lambda=-1,\\ a=-2$；通解为 $x=\\left(\\dfrac32+t,-\\dfrac12,t\\right)^T\\ (t\\in\\mathbb R)$。", "explanation": "“存在两个不同的解”说明该方程组有无穷多解，因此\n$$\n\\det A=0\n$$\n且增广矩阵与系数矩阵同秩。计算\n$$\n\\det A=(\\lambda-1)^2(\\lambda+1).\n$$\n若 $\\lambda=1$，第二行变成 $0=1$，方程组无解，故只能取\n$$\n\\lambda=-1.\n$$\n此时方程组为\n$$\n\\begin{cases}\n-x_1+x_2+x_3=a,\\\\\n-2x_2=1,\\\\\nx_1+x_2-x_3=1.\n\\end{cases}\n$$\n由第二式得 $x_2=-\\dfrac12$。代入第一、三式得\n$$\n-x_1+x_3=a+\\frac12,\\qquad x_1-x_3=\\frac32.\n$$\n两式相容需满足\n$$\na+\\frac12=-\\frac32,\n$$\n故\n$$\na=-2.\n$$\n设 $x_3=t$，则\n$$\nx_1=\\frac32+t,\\qquad x_2=-\\frac12.\n$$\n故通解为\n$$\nx=\\begin{pmatrix}\\frac32+t\\\\-\\frac12\\\\t\\end{pmatrix},\\quad t\\in\\mathbb R.\n$$", "methods": []}
{"question_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010_q023", "exam_id": "kaoyan_math2_2010", "exam_type": "math2", "year": 2010, "question_number": 23, "question_type": "solution", "score": 11, "module": "线性代数", "topics": ["实对称矩阵", "正交对角化"], "difficulty": "unknown", "review_status": "reviewed", "answer_status": "available", "explanation_status": "available", "source_file": "math2_2010_questions.md", "answer_source_file": "math2_2010_answers.md", "card_path": "questions/q023.md", "assets": ["images/source_pages/page-4.png"], "answer": "$a=-1$。可取\n$$\nQ=\\begin{pmatrix}\n\\frac1{\\sqrt6} & \\frac1{\\sqrt2} & \\frac1{\\sqrt3}\\\\\n\\frac2{\\sqrt6} & 0 & -\\frac1{\\sqrt3}\\\\\n\\frac1{\\sqrt6} & -\\frac1{\\sqrt2} & \\frac1{\\sqrt3}\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$", "explanation": "记\n$$\nq_1=\\frac1{\\sqrt6}(1,2,1)^T.\n$$\n由于 $Q^TAQ$ 为对角矩阵，$q_1$ 必是 $A$ 的特征向量。故存在特征值 $\\lambda$ 使\n$$\nA(1,2,1)^T=\\lambda(1,2,1)^T.\n$$\n直接计算得\n$$\nA(1,2,1)^T=(2,5+a,4+2a)^T.\n$$\n故\n$$\n2=\\lambda,\\qquad 5+a=2\\lambda,\\qquad 4+2a=\\lambda,\n$$\n解得\n$$\na=-1,\\qquad \\lambda=2.\n$$\n此时\n$$\nA=\\begin{pmatrix}\n0 & -1 & 4\\\\\n-1 & 3 & -1\\\\\n4 & -1 & 0\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$\n再求与 $q_1$ 正交的两个单位特征向量，可取\n$$\nq_2=\\frac1{\\sqrt2}(1,0,-1)^T,\\qquad q_3=\\frac1{\\sqrt3}(1,-1,1)^T.\n$$\n它们分别对应特征值 $-4,5$，且与 $q_1$ 两两正交。于是可取\n$$\nQ=(q_1,q_2,q_3)\n=\\begin{pmatrix}\n\\frac1{\\sqrt6} & \\frac1{\\sqrt2} & \\frac1{\\sqrt3}\\\\\n\\frac2{\\sqrt6} & 0 & -\\frac1{\\sqrt3}\\\\\n\\frac1{\\sqrt6} & -\\frac1{\\sqrt2} & \\frac1{\\sqrt3}\n\\end{pmatrix}.\n$$", "methods": []}
